WEBVTT

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.350
Where... am I?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.920
Am I...

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.490
saved?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.010
What?

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.650
Umakeko...

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.720
Cover your eyes and ears!

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:27.300
<i>A girl?</i>

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.020
That was a close one.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.320
Yeah.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.530
Thanks for your help, um...

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:54.580
Kuon. My name is Kuon.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.580
Kuon?

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.590
And you are?

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:04.060
Me? I'm...

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.600
Who... am I?

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.980
Does "Kujuuri" ring any bells?

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.440
Nope.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.190
What about "Shishiri province"?

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:21.090
Nope.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:26.740
<i>He doesn't seem familiar with the local geography.</i>

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:27.700
<i>He must be...</i>

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:29.410
I've finished changing.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.620
I'm coming in then.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.570
Am I wearing this right?

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:38.120
I've never seen clothes like these before. They're kind of uncomfortable.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:43.380
Well, I've never seen someone wear them that way, so I'd imagine so.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.840
Huh?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:49.840
R-Really? I thought something was off...

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.670
Isn't there an easier path we could take?

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.410
This <i>is</i> the easiest path.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.600
Are you sure?

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.680
L-Let's take a break.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.580
Again?

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.430
We just took one.

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.810
Cut me some slack.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.690
My feet are killing me!

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.860
I guess he doesn't have much stamina.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:46.860
Or maybe...

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.240
Did you say something?

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.610
No.

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:55.700
Anyway, if we're not out of here by sunset, we'll be food for the animals.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:59.040
A-Are those things common around here?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:06:59.960
What things?

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.250
Those slimy things.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.000
Slimy things?

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.010
You know, like that nasty, gooey thing we saw in the cave.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.260
You mean the curse?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.760
Is that what they're called?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.010
Yeah. If that's what you're talking about, then rest easy.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:20.010
As long as you stay away from their territory, they're unlikely to attack.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:21.390
Unlikely?

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.810
Well, there are always exceptions.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.520
We'll worry about it if we run into one{} again.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:31.280
A slight cold breeze is all it takes to kill a person, if the circumstances are bad.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.580
Well, I suppose.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:37.540
Don't worry.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.540
I'm responsible for your life, since I found you.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.040
Responsible?

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:46.040
I'll take care of you as your guardian.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.670
My guardian?

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:51.550
And that's why I'm going to bring you to my village safely.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.300
There, break time's over.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:56.720
Hold on, let's rest a bit longer.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:00.560
You can if you'd like, but the forest wakes up after sunset.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:09.070
So if you're okay with being hunted, then sure, take your time.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.330
If we keep up this pace, we should reach the village before nightfall.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.770
<i>Well, since I have no clue where I am,</i>

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.040
<i>following her is the best course of action right now.</i>

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:30.130
<i>I wouldn't survive out here for long by myself.</i>

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.730
What are you doing!?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.480
B-But...

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:54.120
You can't just touch a girl's tail without permission!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.740
I-Is that thing real?

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.240
Of course it is!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.480
No, but...

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.870
But there's no way people have tails...

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.000
<i>And not just the tail; she has the ears too.</i>

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:10.710
Apologize!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:12.750
I'm waiting.

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:23.310
Ow...

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.270
And here I thought we'd make it.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.770
I can't believe we're spending the night out here.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.280
If you have something to say, tell it to the mountain and its stupid hills.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.280
I've never seen someone voice their complaints to nature before.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.240
Well, how is it?

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.340
What do you mean?

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.910
Have you remembered anything?

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.910
Nope, not a bit.

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.490
Wh-What is it?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.040
You don't seem too concerned.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:54.050
Well, it's not like I can do anything about it.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.100
Maybe you're right.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.140
Do you always travel around like this, Kuon?

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:04.810
Yeah.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.310
So you have some kind of a goal?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:13.320
I do have a goal, but it's not 
anything particularly pressing.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:14.940
More than anything,

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:21.290
I want to experience new sights and sounds in places I've never been before.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:24.870
If I don't miss any opportunities now, 
I can't regret them later.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.330
You know?

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.260
Sound asleep already.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.280
Finally!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.120
Just a bit further, so hang in there.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.000
H-Hey, where are you going?

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.750
To the inn.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.750
The inn?{The Eien?}

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:27.510
So Kuon's not the only one like that, huh.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.770
You're a day late.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.150
A lot happened.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.890
Here are the herbs you ordered.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.950
My, my, thank you.{}

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.740
Staying for the night, I presume?

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:47.030
Your usual room's open.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:49.950
Two this time. Is that okay?

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:50.660
Two?

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.040
Hello.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.040
Of course.

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.050
Just write your names here.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.420
Thanks.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.090
Um...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:05.550
Is something the matter?

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.930
Come to think of it, what's your name?

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:12.680
I haven't got a clue, and I doubt it'll come to me if I try.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:18.690
Not having a name is somewhat inconvenient, so let's think one up for you.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.270
You're right.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.700
<i>Now that I think about it, 
this might be a good opportunity.</i>

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:28.280
<i>With my missing memories, 
I'm pretty much a blank slate.</i>

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:34.080
<i>I can come up with an awe-inspiring name without anyone objecting.</i>

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:37.460
<i>It needs to be one that I'll never regret.</i>

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.920
In that case, I'll give you a name.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.150
Sure, go ahead.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.460
Wait, why!?

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.260
What do you mean why?

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.470
As your guardian, the responsibility of naming you rests with me.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.470
Um, but...

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:53.480
If you think you'll be fine alone without my assistance,

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.480
then do as you please.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.480
Fine!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.230
Then it's settled.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:05.580
Give me the most awe-inspiring name you've got.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.210
Leave it to me!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.660
Let's see...

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.080
If you can't decide, then I'll...

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:19.750
I've got it!

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.260
Haku!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:25.760
Huh?

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.550
No, not "Huh." Your name is Haku.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:31.360
Henceforth, refer to yourself as Haku.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.180
Haku, huh.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.770
It's plain.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:36.520
Did you say something?

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.520
N-No.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:42.650
This name comes from noble origins.{}

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.030
Noble origins?

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:44.780
Yes.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.530
It's the name of one of Those Who Are Sung.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:53.130
Haku, huh?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.000
Come sit here, Haku.

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:01.000
Haku?

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.460
Hey, Haku!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:07.010
It's not polite to ignore someone.

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:10.250
I'm still not used to being called Haku.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.510
Cut me some slack.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:15.890
But it's such a noble name.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.520
So you say, but...

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.020
Did you say something? {}

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.020
Not at all.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.690
You two must be close.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:27.100
Here you go. Eat as much as you like.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:28.530
Thank you!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:31.920
What an absurd amount.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.430
Without further ado, let's eat!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.600
It's so good!

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.180
Don't tell me you don't know how to eat it.

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:59.260
Well, yeah, I guess.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:02.190
Then allow me to demonstrate.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:05.190
First, you take an amamu shell.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:07.690
This thing?

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.740
Place meat, fish, vegetables, or anything you like on top.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.340
Then wrap it around like so.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.950
Ta-da! One amamunii, all done!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.450
All done...

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.960
Dip in your choice of sauce and eat!


00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.800
It's so good!

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.220
This <i>is</i> good.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:32.220
Isn't it?

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.050
Dig in!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:34.970
I would,

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.970
but there's nothing left.

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:43.980
That sure hit the spot.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:47.270
Still eating?

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.990
If you're full, go ahead and use the bath.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.740
Thanks, I think I'll do that.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.000
Finally, a chance to rest.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.670
I've been walking in the mountains for ages.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.460
I'm stiff all over.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.050
Ow...

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.760
The skin's all torn up.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.970
I should probably stretch.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:20.640
Let me see.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:23.190
One, two, three, four,

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.980
five, six, seven...

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.110
Whoops, the towel came undone.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:28.340
Oh well.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.740
First, a shaking exercise to stretch my hands and feet.

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:32.820
Shake!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:36.110
I can feel my muscles loosening up.{} 
Next, let's up the speed!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.120
Now to add a spin!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.420
What's wrong?

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:50.300
Nothing!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.250
If you say so.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:01.140
I'll make a salve for your wounds, so stay put.

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:02.840
Oh, thanks. That'd be great.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:06.820
You're not really built for the mountains, huh?

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.570
Yeah, I found that out the hard way.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.360
Sorry for pushing you past your limit.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.260
Rest up for today.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.710
Thanks, I will.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.730
Hey, Kuon.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.830
Thanks for everything.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.080
Th-There, I said it.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.790
Of course.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:31.300
I'm your guardian, after all.

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.670
It's done.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.340
It might sting a bit, but it'll do the job well.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:50.740
How the hell is that "a bit"!?

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:06.530
It doesn't hurt at all.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.370
Good morning, Haku!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.420
Wash your face and get ready.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.590
Get ready? For what?

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:15.800
We're going out to help the villagers.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.380
Huh?

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:19.640
"He who does not work, neither shall he eat."

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.340
Once we get this stuff unloaded, 
we can grab ourselves some grub!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.770
Can't we rest a bit longer before working?

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.450
You'll heal quicker if you move around.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:34.150
I'd just be in the way if I 
suddenly barged in to help.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.810
I've already spoken to the inn's owner.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.160
I'm still worried about my feet.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.530
Do they still hurt?

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.910
I'll bring the salve right away.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.410
That's okay. No need for that.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.300
What's wrong?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.090
Oh, it's nothing.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.180
He's no good at cutting wood.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.690
He's no good at drawing water.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.440
Th-Thanks.

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:30.120
And he's no good at carrying goods either.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:31.830
Hmm...

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.510
We used to grind amamu with the waterwheel here,

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:40.970
but it seems to be broken.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:44.440
So we're using this instead.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.620
And you want me to turn this thing?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.980
That's right. It doesn't require 
much strength, so you'll be fine.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:53.390
See?

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.690
Well, if it's that simple...

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.030
Great!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:02.390
Well, I have to attend to something. Do your best.

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:08.490
Well, I'll start with taking a break!

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.250
You'll start with <i>what</i>?

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.930
Do your job properly, please.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.880
The village can't go without it.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.050
Fine.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:22.930
I guess I'll actually take this seriously.

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:33.350
How'd I do?

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.400
I gave it everything I had,

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.770
so it should almost be done.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:38.770
That's all?

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.570
I quit!

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.280
I can't do this!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.780
We're not supposed to do this manually, anyhow!

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.790
If it's broken, we should just fix it.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.420
It doesn't look that complicated.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.920
This is connected here,

00:20:59.250 --> 00:20:59.920
that leads there,

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.960
and it transfers the energy from here and...

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:04.720
Aha! Here we go!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.400
Is that lunch?

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:18.720
Yes.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:22.110
Now that he's finally working, I thought I'd bring him lunch.

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.950
Ah, to be young.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.450
He must be hungry.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.630
All right! Now it's time to sleep.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:44.210
My, how impressive.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:49.620
Phew, it's not Kuon.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.810
I heard the waterwheel was broken.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.800
Did you fix it?

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.730
Yeah,

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.980
but don't tell anyone.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.480
Why not?

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:03.570
If they find out, they'll give me more work to do.

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:05.990
Why should I get more work?

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.740
You're a funny guy!

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:12.950
Rest easy, I won't tell a soul.

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:13.950
I'm counting on you.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.750
Yeah, see ya.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:19.580
Okay, now I can...

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.130
Now you can <i>what</i>?

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:26.880
I said "He who does not work, 
neither shall he eat," remember?

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:29.260
W-Wait, I can explain!

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:30.840
Don't, stop!

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:38.600
You should've just said that you fixed the waterwheel.

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:40.900
You started strangling me before I could even say anything.

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:46.110
Are you better at work that uses your head?

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:49.910
Why do I need to work so much in the first place?

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:52.560
