00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:57.620
To a safe journey! Cheers!

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:06.630
Hey! It's a bit of a racket, I know,

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:08.170
but don't hold it against them.

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:10.430
Hey, you're...

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:13.600
I haven't introduced myself yet, have I?

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:17.240
{Name's Ukon. Ukon call me the leader of this bunch.}Name's Ukon. I'm the boss of this bunch.
